  "description": "Dependency-injection helpers and API endpoint mappings for a bookshelf image parsing pipeline: upload validation, OpenCV segmentation, Tesseract OCR, spine parsing, genre classification, and Open Library lookup with in-pipeline metadata enrichment. Call AddBookshelfReader() and AddBookshelfReaderApi() to wire the pipeline into an ASP.NET Core app, plus optional API-key auth (AddBookshelfReaderApiKey()) and parse rate limiting (AddBookshelfReaderRateLimiting()). Pulls in Windows-only native dependencies (OpenCvSharp4.Windows, Tesseract).",
